    "\n",
    "**Hardware Support:** Google Colab Free T4 (16GB) ya Colab Pro A100 (40GB)\n",
    "**Base Model:** Wan 2.1 / CogVideoX via Hugging Face Diffusers"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
